# ============================================================================
# Generated Gin Config
#
# Optimizations:
#   - Attention Backend: cutlass
#   - Recompute LayerNorm: False
#   - Workload Balancer: Enabled
#   - DynamicEmb Caching: False
#   - Cache Ratio: 0.0
